Preface

The present book includes extended and revised versions of a set of selected papers from the 2021 and 2022 editions of CHIRA - The International Conference on ComputerHuman Interaction Research and Applications. CHIRA 2021 was exceptionally held as online event, due to COVID-19, and CHIRA 2022 was held in Valletta, Malta as a hybrid event.
CHIRA 2021 received 48 paper submissions from 20 countries, of which 4% were included in this book. CHIRA 2022 received 37 paper submissions from 17 countries, of which 17% were included in this book.
